      "answer": {
        "summary": "2026-06-30 至 2026-09-30，门店6订单净收入为29791.300000000000200000000000000000、订单数44；同期展示23种耗材的负向库存变动（库存减少）。",
        "keyFindings": [
          "消耗量较大的耗材为亮肤软膜粉-200、补水软膜粉-100、院装温和洁面乳-100、舒缓修护面膜-98。",
          "其后为水润柔肤水-70、头皮养护精华-69、射频仪器导入凝胶-66。",
          "库存流水笔数最多的是院装温和洁面乳21笔，其次是一次性面巾17笔。",
          "订单净收入和订单数为门店本季度汇总值，在每个耗材行中重复展示，不应按耗材行累计。",
          "耗材消耗数量与收入金额单位不同，仅作并列展示，未计算差额、比率或投入产出。"
        ],
        "caveats": [
          "耗材消耗仅统计quantity < 0的库存变动，movement_quantity为负数表示库存减少。",
          "数据范围为门店6，时间为2026-06-30至2026-09-30。"
        ]
      },
      "redactedSql": "WITH revenue AS (\n  SELECT\n    SUM(o.net_amount) AS net_revenue,\n    COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id) AS order_count\n  FROM agent_v3_order_summary_view AS o\n  WHERE o.store_id = ANY(:allowedStoreIds)\n    AND o.order_created_at >= :startAt::timestamptz\n    AND o.order_created_at < :endAt::timestamptz\n)\nSELECT\n  s.product_id,\n  s.product_name,\n  s.sku,\n  MAX(r.net_revenue) AS net_revenue,\n  MAX(r.order_count) AS order_count,\n  SUM(s.quantity) AS movement_quantity,\n  COUNT(s.movement_id) AS movement_count\nFROM agent_v3_stock_movement_view AS s\nCROSS JOIN revenue AS r\nWHERE s.store_id = ANY(:allowedStoreIds)\n  AND s.occurred_at >= :startAt::timestamptz\n  AND s.occurred_at < :endAt::timestamptz\n  AND s.quantity < 0\nGROUP BY s.product_id, s.product_name, s.sku\nLIMIT 100;"
    }
  ]
